@api = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Kiem tra API hoat dong -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach san pham -> 200, 3 san pham khi khoi dong moi
GET {{api}}/api/products

### 3. San pham ton tai -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### 4. Id hop le nhung khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### 5. Id khong phai so nguyen -> 404 tu framework, body rong
GET {{api}}/api/products/abc

### 6. Tao san pham hop le -> 201 + Location
# @name createProduct
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}

### 7. Du lieu khong hop le -> 400 + ApiError
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "San pham loi",
  "description": "",
  "price": -1
}

### 8. Thieu Content-Type -> 415 tu framework
POST {{api}}/api/products

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}
